  "solution": {
    "text": "Victor Meyer's test: The various steps involved are\n(i)$\\mathrm{RCH}_2 \\mathrm{OH} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{HI}} \\mathrm{RCH}_2 \\mathrm{I} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{AgNO}_2} \\mathrm{RCH}_2 \\mathrm{NO}_2$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/6iIQAI-TBZnt-PDmq6SmHj70SLhGd_D0HvDrp-g1PmI.original.fullsize.png\"/>\n(ii)<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/R3uL1lpbEEJwDUutDa0O_MKdutBz5BxHsuvglvAOQY8.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/g2OZIy1Q0ZPrdwalYHWWzxwPNnMOQq8T1AqyesW8BaU.original.fullsize.png\"/>\n(iii)\n$\\mathrm{R}_3 \\mathrm{COH} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{HI}} \\mathrm{R}_3 \\mathrm{CI} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{AgNO}_2} \\mathrm{R}_3 \\mathrm{CNO}_2$\n$-\\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{HNO}_2}$ No reaction $\\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{KOH}}$ Colourless",
